# ============================================================================
# COMMIT POLICY — READ BEFORE COMMITTING
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NO Claude tags on any commit under any circumstances.
# NO AI-assistant attribution of any kind (Claude, Anthropic, Copilot, etc.).
#
# Every commit must be attributable to a human team member. Forbidden lines:
#   Co-Authored-By: Claude ...
#   Co-Authored-By: <anything>@anthropic.com
#   Claude-Session: ...
#   🤖 Generated with Claude Code (or any variation)
#   Any link to claude.ai/code or claude.ai/chat
#
# Enforcement:
#   .githooks/commit-msg — blocks the commit locally
#   .githooks/pre-push   — blocks the push if any commit in the push range
#                          carries a forbidden tag
#
# Wire them into your clone once, after cloning:
#   ./scripts/setup-git-hooks.sh
#
# Full policy: see COMMIT_POLICY.md
# ============================================================================
scripts/bsa_exp_recalibration.py

